<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555460/extras/1753a8c46395b94a3363ba4cb2447bab.avif?t=1755199629\" width=620 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies grow in numbers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On higher difficulties enemies are not just becoming tougher and stronger. Their real danger comes from their ever increasing numbers. Be prepared to shoot yourself through thousands of enemies by the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555460/extras/abd519da297ebe919fff87dac67c1641.avif?t=1755199629\" width=620 height=70 /></span></p>",
